# 0G Compute Router (preferred — wallet-funded 0G token billing, OpenAI-compatible)
# 1) Connect wallet at https://pc.0g.ai → Deposit 0G → Dashboard → Create API key
# 2) Paste sk- key below. Billing debits your on-chain 0G balance per token.
# OG_COMPUTE_ROUTER_API_KEY=sk-...
# OG_COMPUTE_NETWORK=mainnet
# OG_COMPUTE_MODEL=zai-org/GLM-5-FP8
# OG_COMPUTE_USD_PER_1K_TOKENS=0.0003
# GROVE_LLM_ENABLED=1

# 0G Direct (wallet via 0g-compute-cli — auto-filled by scripts/setup-agent-0g.sh)
